<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 PETERO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga mukwongo ma Petero ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga mukwongo ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETERO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga man mukwongo Petero ocoyo bot jo ma oye Yecu Kricito macalo Lalargi ma en olwongogi ni “Jo ayera pa Lubanga” ma guket i kabedo mapatpat ma gin onongo tye i lobo matye ite loc pa Luroma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tyen lok madit ma oweko en ocoyo waraga man obedo me cuko cwiny jo ma oye Yecu Kricito macalo Lalargi me bedo kitek cwiny, kadi bed gin tye ka nongo can malit atika ki bot jo ma pyem ki lok pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petero ocuku cwiny jo ma oye me neno lanyut me niye ki bot Yecu Kricito ma olimo can malit atika ni o wa iwang to ma mere. Dong en ocuku cwiny jo pa Lubanga me bedo ki gen makwo pien Yecu bidwogo tyen me aryo kangolo kop pa jo makwo ki jo ma oto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyutu ngat ma ocoyo buk man, dok bot jo mene <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lare ma a ki bot Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Bedo ki kwo mupore ma leng <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13—2:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gin maber me atima ikare me ayelayela <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11—4:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mwolo ki tic pa jo ma oye Yecu Kricito macalo Lalargi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mot me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Petero, lakwena pa Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Bot jo pa Lubanga ma oring ayela ma guket ata, ma gin bedo i Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Acia ki Bitunia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Lubanga Won aye ma oyerogi pi yube ma en ongeyo con, ma Cwiny mere Maleng dong olonyogi gudoko maleng wek guwiny lok pa Yecu Kricito, dok bene wek kikir remone ikomgi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Kica ki kuc myero omede botwu.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gen makwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Gipwo Lubanga Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito! Pien pi kicane madit ma omiyo kinywalowa odoco wek wabed ki gen makwo pi cer pa Yecu Kricito ki ikin jo ma oto, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />ki dok wek wanywak ginaleya ma pe top, ma cilo mo pe ogudu, ma pe bale, ma kikano pirwu i polo. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Lubanga tye ka gwokowu kiteke pi niyewu, wek wunong lare ma kiyubu, ma binen ikare me agiki piny.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Wubed ki yomcwiny piman, kadi bed kombedi gwok nyo cwinywu twero cwer pi kare manoknok mo pi kit ma kitye kaomo ki cwinywu i yo mapatpat, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />wek kinen niyewu, kace tye niye me ada. Pien kadi jabu ma kitemo ki mac pe rii nakanaka, ento niyewa pire dit kato jabu, dok bene bikelo botwu pak ki deyo ki woro i ceng ma Yecu Kricito binen iye. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kadi pud pe wunene, dong wumare. Dok bene kombedi kadi pe wunene, wuye en kun wubedo ki yomcwiny madit ma pe wace, dok bene me deyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Adwogi me niyewu omiyo wunongo lare me tipuwu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Lunebi mayam gutito pi kica ma gibimiyowu yam guyenyo matek, kun gipenyo lok ikom lare man. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Gin yam gumito ni ginge anga, nyo kit kare mene, ma Cwiny pa Kricito matye i igi tye ka nyutu, ikare ma otito iye pi can ma Kricito biciro, ki pi deyo ma dok bilubu. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Yam onongo kinyutu botgi ni, kwena ma kimiyogi pe otiko gin ki komgi, ento otiko wun. En aye lok ma kombedi dong jo ma gitito lok me Kwena Maber gutyeko tito botwu pi Cwiny Maleng ma kicwalo ma oa ki i polo; lok ma lumalaika bene guparo me nenone matek tutwal.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wubed ki kwo maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Pimeno, dong wubed ma wuyube i tamwu, kun wugwoke bene. Wuket genwu ducu ikom kica ma bibino botwu ikare ma Yecu Kricito binen iye. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Macalo lutino ma luwiny, pe wumii kwowu orwate ki mitiwu mayam kong wubedo kwede ikare ma onongo pud wukwiya piny ca <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Kit macalo ngat ma olwongowu leng, wun bene wubed jo maleng i kitwu ducu; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Lev 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref> </char></note> pien coc mayam kicoyo loko ni, “Wubedo jo maleng, pien an aleng.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Ngat ma wulwongoni Wonwuni ngolo kop ikom dano acel acel ma pe lenge, kun lubu kit tic ma ngat acel acel otiyo; ma omiyo myero wubed ki lworo inyime kare ducu ma pud wutye kany macalo welo. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Wun wungeyo ni kityeko kokowu ki ikit pa kwariwu ma pe konyo. Pe kikokowu ki gin ma bale woko, macalo ryal nyo jabu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ento kikokowu ki remo pa Kricito me wel madwong marom ki latin romo ma bal mo nyo roc mo pe ikome. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Lubanga onongo dong otyeko yero en wa con, ma pud pe ocweyo guti me lobo, ka dok onyute woko pirwu ikare man, ma en aye kare me agiki. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Pire omiyo dong wadoko jo ma geno Lubanga ma ocero Yecu ki ikin jo ma oto, ci omiye deyo; en meno gin ma omiyo niyewu ki genwu tye ikom Lubangani.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Dong wulonyo cwinywu woko odoko maleng pi lubu lok ada, wek wubed ki mar ma goba pe iye macalo utmego; pimeno myero wumare kekenwu mada ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Dong kinywalowu odoco, pe ki kodi ma to woko, ento kinywalowu dong ki kodi ma pe to, pi twero me lok pa Lubanga, en lok matye ki kwo ma rii nakanaka; <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Ica 40:6-8</ref> </char></note> pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Dano ducu obedo calo lum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">deyogi ducu rom ki deyo pa tur lum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Lum ner,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ature bene oo woko,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ento lok pa Rwot ma en oloko bedo matwal.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Lok meno en aye lok me Kwena Maber mayam kitito botwu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Got makwo ki rok ma kiyero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Pimeno, dong wubwot rac cwiny ducu, ki kit me goba ducu, ki kit me adwala, nyeko ki kit yet ducu. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Wumit cak magili me cwiny, calo lutino lukere ma pud kinywalogi nyen, wek omii wudong nio i lare; <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Jab 34:8</ref> </char></note> pien dong wutyeko bilo ber pa Rwot.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Wubin bote, en got makwo mayam dano gukwero, ento ki bot Lubanga obedo got me wel ma en oyero. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Wubin macalo godi makwo, wek kiged kwedwu ci wudok ot me cwiny pa Lubanga, wek wubed ajwaki maleng pa Lubanga, ka wutyer gin tum me cwiny ma Lubanga pwoyo, pi Yecu Kricito; <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ica 28:16</ref> </char></note> pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Nen, dong aketo got me wel i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">ma ayero me got me twok ot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">ngat ma oye en, lewic pe bimako.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Jab 118:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Pimeno, ki tung botwu wun jo ma oye en, Kricito obedo me wel; ento ki bot jo ma pe guye en, tye macalo yam kicoyo ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Got ma lugedo gukwero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">en aye odoko got madit mapire tek.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">Ica 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:15">15</ref> </char>
    </note> Odoko bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“got mamiyo dano yoke ka giwoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">ki got mamiyo dano poto.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Giyoke pien gukwero winyo lok pa Lubanga, macalo onongo yam kiyubu pirgi wa con.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Nia 19:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Ica 43:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 43:21">21</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Nia 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Nwo 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:21">Ica 43:21</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">d </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Ica 9:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento wun wubedo rok ma ki yero, ajwaki pa Rwot, rok maleng, jo pa Lubanga kikome, wek wutit pi tic me deyo pa ngat ma olwongowu nia ki i piny macol wek wudony i lengone me aura. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Koc 2:23</ref> </char></note> Yam onongo pe wubedo jo pa Lubanga, ento kombedi dong wudoko jone; yam pe kitimo botwu kica, ento kombedi dong kitimo kica botwu.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wubed calo opii pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Wun ma amaro, abako doga botwu macalo wun welo, pe wun jo me lobo man, wukwer miti me kom woko ma lwenyo ki tipuwu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Wubed ki kit maber ikin Lurok, wek kace kiyetowu ni wun lutim gin marac, gunen tic maber ma wutiyo, wek bene gumi deyo bot Lubanga i nino ma en bibino kangolo kop iye.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Pi Rwotwa, myero wumiine me bedo ite loc me twero ducu matye ikin dano, bot laloc madit, pien en aye maloyo jo ducu, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ki bot luloc ma en ocwalogi pi keto can ikom jo ma lutim maracu, ki pi pwoyo jo ma timo gin ma atir. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Pien Lubanga mito ni wutii gin ma atir, wek wumii jo maming ma gikwiya piny guling woko. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Wubed macalo jo ma lone ken gi, ento pe wutii ki locken meno pi timo gin marac; wubed giwu macalo opii pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Wuwor dano ducu. Wumar luwotwu. Wulwor Lubanga. Wuwor laloc madit.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lapor me can ma Kricito olimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Wun opii, wumiine kenwu ite loc pa luditowu ki kit woro ducu, pe bot jo ma lukica ki jo mamwol keken, ento bot jo mager bene. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Man aye gin ma kipwoyo, kace dano ciro arem ma nongo cwinye tye ikom Lubanga, ka kiune ma nongo pe obalo. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kipwoyowu pi ngo, ka wudiyo cwinywu ma nongo kipwodowu pi bal? Ento kace wudiyo cwinywu ma nongo wutye kaneno can pi timo gin maber, meno aye Lubanga pwoyo. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Pien kilwongowu pi gin meno; pien Kricito bene yam oneno can pirwu, oweko botwu lapor maber me aluba, wek wulub kore. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Ica 53:9</ref> </char></note> Bal mo peke ma en otimo, doge bene pe oloko lok goba. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ica 53:7</ref> </char></note> Ikare ma dano guyete, en pe oyetogi. Ikare ma en oneno can, pe oburu dano; ento omine kene bot ngat ma ngolo kop atir. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Ica 53:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:6">6</ref> </char></note> Ento en otingo balwa ikome kene ikom yatariya, wek wan wagik timo bal, ka dong wabed kwo ikit ma atir. Pi pwod ma kipwode kwede omiyo wucang. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Pien yam onongo wungak wurwenyo woko calo romi, ento kombedi dong wudwogo bot Lakwat ki Lagwok tipuwu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mon ki coggi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Kitmeno bene, wun mon wumiine me bedo ite loc pa cogwu, wek kace co mogo ikin gi pe gilubu lok pa Lubanga, ci gitwero loke pi kit pa mon gi, kadi bed wun ki komwu pe wuloko lok mo ki dogwu, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />pien gin bineno kitwu maleng manen me woro. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tem 2:9</ref> </char></note> Rukwu pe obed ruk manen ki woko, macalo kedo yer wic, tweyo tiko jabu, ruku bongi mabeco, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />ento rukwu myero obed kit me cwiny ma pe nen. Ruk ma pe bale en cwiny mamwol, ma ling mot; meno aye wele dit inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Pien ikare macon, mon maleng ma gumoko gen gi ikom Lubanga yam giruke kitmeno, kun bene gimine ken gi me bedo ite loc pa coggi, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Aca 18:12</ref> </char></note> macalo Cara yam winyo lok pa Abraim, kun pake bene ni, “Rwoda.” Wun bene kombedi dong wun lutinone, ka wutiyo gin maber, kun pe gin mo miyowu lworo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Epe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Kitmeno bene, wun co wupar pi monwu kun wuparo pirgi, kun wumiyo woro bot dako macalo lawoti ma kome pe tek, pien gin bene ginywako kica pa Lubanga kwedwa ma en aye kelo kwo. Kumeno gin mo pe ma bigengo legawu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Neno can pi lubu kit ma atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Me agikine, wun ducu wubed ki tam acel dok ki cwiny acel. Wumare calo utmego, ma wutye ki kica dok ki cwiny mamwol. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Pe wudwok tim marac pi tim marac, nyo yet ki yet; ento ma ka timo meno, wuleg gum pa Lubanga obed ikomgi, pien kilwongowu piman, wek wunong gum. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Jab 34:12-16</ref> </char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Ngat ma maro kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">ki ma mito ni eri pi kare malac kun bedo maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">myero ogwok lebe pe olok gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">ki doge bene pe olok lok me bwola.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Oa woko ki i gin marac, otii gin maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">oyeny kuc dok otii matek me nongo ne.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Pien Rwot neno jo ma kitgi atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">dok ciko ite, winyo legagi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">ento dag neno jo ma lutim maracu.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Anga mono ma bitimowu marac ka wuketo cwinywu me tiyo gin maber? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref> </char></note> Ento kadi bed wuneno can pi lubu kit ma atir, ci wutye ki gum. Pe wulworgi, dok cwinywu bene pe opoti,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Ica 8:12</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:13">13</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />ento wuwor Kricito icwinywu macalo Rwotwu. Wubed ma wuyube kare ducu pi dok ilok ma dano bipenyowu kwede ikom gen ma wutye kwede; <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />ento wudok iye ki mwolo dok ki woro. Wubed ma cwinywu leng, wek lewic omak jo ma yeto kitwu maber i Kricito, ka kinywarowu. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Bedo ber ka wuneno can pi timo gin maber, kace Lubanga mito kitmeno, loyo ma wuneno can pi timo gin marac. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Pien Kricito bene yam oneno can pi bal, kicel ma otyeko lok ducu; en ngat ma kite atir oto pi jo ma kitgi pe atir, wek omii ekelwa bot Lubanga. Yam kineko kome, ento kicere woko i cwiny. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />En yam owoto i cwiny ocito otito lok pa Lubanga bot tipu pa jo matye ibuc, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Aca 6:1—7:24</ref> </char></note> mayam con pe guwinyo Lubanga, kadi bed Lubanga odiyo cwinye ikomgi ikare pa Nua ma onongo en tye ka payo yeya, ma dano manok maromo aboro keken aye gulare ki i pii. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Gin man cimo batija ma koni larowu; pe me lwoko cilo me kom, ento obedo macalo lega bot Lubanga wek wudok jo ma cwinywu leng, pi cer pa Yecu Kricito, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />madong odok woko ipolo, ikabedo me deyo inget Lubanga tung acuc, kun lumalaika ki twer kiteko ducu gin tye i teloce.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kwo ma oloke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Kit macalo Kricito yam ociro arem me kom, wun bene myero wuruke ki tam acel kitmeno, wek kimiwu tek. Pien ngat mo madong ociro arem kom, pe dong mede ki bal, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />wek etyek kare me kwone i lobo man ma pud odong kun pe dok lubu miti maracu ma dano paro, ento cobo gin ma Lubanga mito. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Myero dong wuwek kare mayam wubedo iye katiyo gin ma jo ma pe ngeyo Lubanga gimaro timo oromwu. Yam wulubu kit me tarwang, ki miti me kom, mero, karama me woro cam ki tuku marac, mat, ki woro jogi. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Giuru mada pien kombedi dong pe wuribe kwedgi ilok man me miti me kom ma pe juke; meno aye ma omiyo kinywarowu. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ento gibidok ilok man bot Lubanga ma oyube pi ngolo kop pa jo makwo ki jo ma oto. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Man en aye gin ma omiyo yam gitito lok me Kwena Maber kadi wa bot jo ma oto, wek kadi kingolo kop ikomgi macalo kingolo ki jo ducu, gin gubed kwo i cwiny macalo Lubanga.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Agiki me jami ducu dong cok; pimeno wugwok kitwu, kun wuloyo mitiwu kenwu, wek wumiine i lego Lubanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Car 10:12</ref> </char></note> Makato ducu wumok matek i mare kekenwu; pien mar umu lwak bal mapol. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Wubed jo ma jolo welo ngat man ki lawote, kun pe wungur bene. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kit macalo ngat acel acel tye ki mote ma kimiye, wutii kwede pi konye kekenwu, macalo lugwok jami mabeco, ma tiyo ki mot me kica ma Lubanga omiyo ma kite patpat. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ka ngat mo tito lok, myero otit macalo lok ma oa ki bot Lubanga; ngat mamiyo kony otii macalo ngat ma tiyo kitek ma Lubanga omiyo; wek dano guket deyo ikom Lubanga i yo ducu pi Yecu Kricito. Deyo ki twero bedo mere nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ciro can pi bedo ngat ma oye Yecu Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Luwota ma amaro, pe wuur can marom ki mac ma bino ikomwu pi temowu, ma kun wutamo ni meno obedo gin mo mapat tutwal mupoto ikomwu. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ento wubed ki yomcwiny ka wuribe i can pa Kricito, wek dok wubed ki yomcwiny madit ikare ma deyone binen. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Wutye ki gum ka kiyetowu pi nying Kricito, pien nongo cwiny me deyo, ma en Cwiny pa Lubanga, bedo ikomwu. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ka ngat mo neno can ikinwu, ci pe omyero obed pi nek, nyo pi kwo, nyo pi timo gin mo marac, nyo pi laro lok i gin pa ngat mo mukene. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ento ka kiketo can ikom dano mo pi bedo ngat ma oye Kricito, lewic pe myero omake, ento omii deyo bot Lubanga pi lwonge ki nying meno. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Pien kare me cako ngolo kop dong oromo, kun cake ki bot jo pa Lubanga. Man ka ocake ki botwa, ci agiki pa jo ma gukwero winyo lok me Kwena Maber ma oa ki bot Lubanga bibedo ningning? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Car 11:31</ref> </char></note> Coc mayam kicoyo waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Kace bedo tek bot dano ma kite atir me lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">ci dong ngo ma bitime ikom labalo ma pe lworo Lubanga?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Pimeno, jo ma gineno can i yo ma Lubanga mito, ber gumine ken gi i cing Lacwec ma gene, kun gitiyo gin ma atir.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wukwa romi pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Abako doga bot ludongo ma gitye ikinwu, an ma ladit wadiwu ma abedo caden i can pa Kricito, dok bene abinywako i deyone ma binen. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Jon 21:15-17</ref> </char></note> Wukwa romi pa Lubanga matye botwu, kun wunenogi maber, pe pi dic, ento pi mitiwu kenwu, ikit ma Lubanga mito, pe pi lim, ento pi mit me cwinywu. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Pe wulo loc kitek ikom dano ma kiketo i cingwu, ento wubed lanen maber bot romi; <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />miyo ka Lakwat madit binen, wun wubinongo mot, lalukana me deyo ma pe bale. <verse eid="1PE 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Car 3:34</ref> </char></note> Kitmeno, wun bulu bene, wuwiny loc pa ludongo. Wun ducu wuruke ki mwolo, ngat acel acel inyim lawote, pien kicoyo ni, “Lubanga dag jo ma wake, ento miyo kica bot jo mamwol.”<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Wumwole kenwu ite twero pa Lubanga, wek ka kare oromo en otingwu malo. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Wuket parwu ducu ikome, pien en tamo pirwu. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Wugwoke, wuki piny, pien lakworwu Catan tye kawire macalo labwor ma kok, kun yenyo dano me amwoda. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Wucung matek inyime pi niye kun wungeyo ni, utmegiwu ma gitye i lobo ducu gitye ka ciro kit can macalo meno. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ka dong wuneno can pi kare manok, Lubanga lami kica ducu, ma olwongowu i Kricito Yecu me nywako deyone ma rii nakanaka, en kikome aye ma bidwokowu kakare, bimiyowu tek, dok bimiyo wucung matek liking. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Loc obed bote nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:22">Tic 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref> </char>
    </note> Acoyo waraga man botwu manok ki kony pa Silvano, ma angeyo ada ni en ominwa ma gene, pi cuko cwinywu kun aloko macalo caden ni, man en kica pa Lubanga ada. Dong wucung iye matek. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tic 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref> </char></note> Jo ducu ma oye Kricito ma gitye i Babilon ma Lubanga oyerogi kacel kwedwu gumotowu, ki woda Marako bene omotowu. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Wumote kekenwu ki mot me mar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Kuc obed botwu wun ducu ma wutye i Kricito.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>